<title>BELGIUM: Belgium appoints new envoy to Great Lakes region.</title>
<headline>Belgium appoints new envoy to Great Lakes region.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium has appointed a new envoy to the Great Lakes region of central Africa, the Belgian foreign ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Renier Nijskens, Belgium's ambassador to Kenya, replaces Yves Haesendonck, who is to become chief of staff to Belgian Foreign Minister Erik Derycke.</p>
<p>The appointment would take effect shortly, a foreign ministry spokesman said.</p>
<p>Belgium has close ties with the Great Lakes region, being the former colonial power in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (formerly Zaire), Rwanda and Burundi.</p>
</text>
